      "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:01:05.716Z",
      "cooked": "<p>L’Episte: “You Only Lunge Once”.</p>\n<p>I love the idea that Time Cataclysm might be the Paradoja Magnifica as a location.</p>\n<p>You could definitely do an edgy steamy goth romance fanfic where FB is like “must kill…can’t wait til we make port…must kill now” and Trueshot takes a stimpack and is like “I will give you the death you crave…a little death!”  Definitely those exact words.</p>\n<p>What’s rated R?</p>",
